# The Ruins of Alph (outside, the research centre and the chambers): old stones and a puzzle nobody has solved, a
# slow ocarina in D Dorian over a hushed pad, a harp that turns in fourths and a low drone. Original composition for
# this game (plan 20 · J5).
title Ruins of Alph
tempo 80
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5
nighttempo 0.95

track lead ocarina night=flute vol=0.66 pan=0 rev=0.5
  L o5 d4 e4 f4 a4 | o5 g2 e4 c4 | o5 d4 f4 e4 c4 | o5 d2. r4 |
  o5 a4 g4 f4 e4 | o5 f2 d4 e4 | o5 c4 d4 e4 g4 | o5 a2. r4 |
  o5 b4 a4 g4 e4 | o5 f2 a4 g4 | o5 e4 d4 c4 e4 | o5 d2. r4 |

track pluck harp night=pizzicato vol=0.36 pan=-0.25 rev=0.44
  L [ o4 d4 g4 o5 c4 o4 g4 | ]12

track pad pad vol=0.26 pan=0.25 rev=0.56
  L o3 (d a)1 | (c g)1 | (d a)1 | (d a)1 |
  (f >c)1 | (d a)1 | (c g)1 | (d a)1 |
  (g >d)1 | (f >c)1 | (c g)1 | (d a)1 |

track bass contrabass vol=0.46 rev=0.24
  L o3 d1 | c1 | d1 | d1 |
  f1 | d1 | c1 | d1 |
  g1 | f1 | c1 | d1 |
